' ========================================================================================
' * Retrieves an enumeration value of type STORAGE_BUS_TYPE that indicates the type of bus
' to which the device is connected. 
' Parameter:
' wszPath: The name of the file or device to be created or opened.
'          You may use either forward slashes (/) or backslashes (\) in this name.
' - Drives  : "//./PhysicalDrive0" -> "//./C:"
'             "//./PhysicalDrive1" -> "//./D:"
' - Volumes : "//./C:"
' - Drivers : "//./DriverName"
' Return values:
'   STORAGE_BUS_TYPE : Enumeration
